 "remarks": "Welcome to Heights Crossing, a newly constructed luxury apartment community in Darien, offering refined living with immediate access to New York City via the train station just across the street.  This expansive corner residence with 2 bedrooms and 2.5 baths is defined by double-story windows and a vaulted living room ceiling, creating a striking architectural focal point that fills the space with natural light. A proper foyer entry sets the tone upon arrival.   The kitchen is both functional and beautifully composed, featuring GE Profile appliances, quartz countertops with a designer backsplash, custom cabinetry, and a bar-height island designed for casual dining and effortless entertaining.  Both ensuite bedrooms are generously scaled. The primary bedroom lives as a true suite, complete with multiple closets and a well-appointed bath with a stall shower. A stacked full-sized washer and dryer, privacy shades and a powder room provide thoughtful convenience.   Heights Crossing offers secure access, elevator service, garage parking, on-site management, a fitness center, golf simulator, coworking spaces, and a resident lounge with WiFi. A landscaped courtyard with a central fountain and curated ground-level retail complete the experience.",
